---
const tenets = [
  {
    n: "i.",
    h: "Sit with the fuzzy part.",
    p: "The first version of the problem is almost never the real one. I stay in ambiguity for longer than is comfortable, because that's where the real brief lives.",
  },
  {
    n: "ii.",
    h: "Design the system, not the screen.",
    p: "Any single screen is easy. What's hard is a system that lets a hundred screens stay coherent while five teams ship into it every week.",
  },
  {
    n: "iii.",
    h: "Trust is a UI problem.",
    p: "Especially with AI. Show the reasoning. Ask before spending anything. Leave a way back out. Confidence is not the same as helpfulness.",
  },
  {
    n: "iv.",
    h: "Ship it, then keep listening.",
    p: "Launch day is a checkpoint, not a finish line. Some of my favorite fixes have arrived weeks after the demo, from watching real people use the thing.",
  },
];
---

<section id="process" class="process reveal">
  <p class="eyebrow">/ how i think</p>
  <h2 class="manifesto">
    My <em>process</em> isn't a checklist.<br />
    It's more like a <em>way of paying attention.</em>
  </h2>
  <ol class="tenets">
    {tenets.map((t) => (
      <li>
        <p class="tl-num">{t.n}</p>
        <div>
          <h4>{t.h}</h4>
          <p>{t.p}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .process {
    padding-top: 8rem;
  }
  .manifesto {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 500;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .tenets {
    margin: 3.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  .tenets li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .tl-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 2rem;
  }
  .tenets h4 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .tenets p {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .tenets {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
